#: case_study.md:1
msgid "Case study: TDP-43 WtoA monomer dynamics"
msgstr "Case Study：TDP-43 WtoA Monomer の Dynamics"

#: case_study.md:3
msgid ""
"Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS) and frontotemporal lobar degeneration "
"(FTLD) are two of the most common debilitating neurodegenerative diseases "
"(NDs) in people aged between 45 and 65 years. Thepathological hallmark of "
"these diseases is the presence of proteinaceous cytoplasmic inclusions in "
"degenerating neurons. TDP-43 is the primary component of the cytoplasmic "
"inclusions in ~97$\\%$ of ALS and ~45$\\%$ of FTLD cases. Increasing "
"evidence suggests that cellular changes leading to TDP-43 mislocalization "
"and aggregation in the cytoplasm resulting in the gain of toxic functions "
"that drive neurodegeneration in ALS and FTLD-"
"TDP[ref](https://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-023-01341-4). TDP-43 is equipped The"
" sequence of TDP-43 comprises 414 amino acids, which form different domains "
"(Figure 3). These domains include a folded N-terminal domain (residues "
"1-76), a disordered region (residues 77-105), a folded RNA recognition motif"
" (residues 106-176), a second disordered region (residues 177-190), another "
"folded RNA recognition motif (residues 191-259), and an long disordered "
"C-terminal domain (residues 274-414), which contains a glycine-rich region, "
"is involved in protein-protein interactions, and harbors most of the "
"mutations associated with "
"ALS[ref](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33177049/)."
msgstr ""
"Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis (ALS) と Frontotemporal Lobar Degeneration "
"(FTLD) は、45〜65歳で多い、重い障害をもたらす神経変性疾患 (NDs) "
"です。変性する神経細胞の細胞質にタンパク質性封入体があることが病理学的特徴です。TDP-43 は ALS の約97$\\%$、FTLD "
"の約45$\\%$ でその主要成分です。TDP-43 の局在異常と細胞質内 Aggregation を生む細胞変化が、毒性機能の獲得を通じて ALS と"
" FTLD-TDP の神経変性を引き起こすことを示す証拠が増えています "
"[文献](https://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-023-01341-4)。TDP-43 の414アミノ酸は、異なる Domain"
" を形成します（図3）。Folded N-terminal Domain（1〜76）、Disordered 領域（77〜105）、Folded RNA "
"Recognition Motif（106〜176）、第2の Disordered 領域（177〜190）、別の Folded RNA "
"Recognition Motif（191〜259）、長い Disordered C-terminal Domain（274〜414）です。最後の "
"Domain は Glycine-rich 領域を含み、Protein-Protein 相互作用に関わり、ALS に関連する変異の多くが集中します "
"[文献](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33177049/)。"

#: case_study.md:5
msgid ""
"Due to the interplay between well folded domains and disordered regions, "
"TDP-43 monomer challenges experimental structure determination approaches. "
"In particular a recent study of the WtoA TDP-43 revealed the SAXS intensity "
"profile of TDP-43 "
"monomer[Ref](https://www.cell.com/iscience/fulltext/S2589-0042(20)30344-8?_returnURL=https%3A%2F%2Flinkinghub.elsevier.com%2Fretrieve%2Fpii%2FS2589004220303448%3Fshowall%3Dtrue)."
" Due to its societal relevance and challenging target for experimental "
"structural biology, we have selected TDP-43 WtoA as a protein to simulate "
"its structural ensemble by AF-MI and compare to experimental data in the "
"original AF-MI "
"[paper](https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.01.19.524720v1.full)."
msgstr ""
"Folded Domain と Disordered 領域の相互作用により、TDP-43 Monomer の実験的な構造決定は困難です。最近の WtoA"
" TDP-43 の研究では Monomer の SAXS Intensity Profile が報告されました "
"[文献](https://www.cell.com/iscience/fulltext/S2589-0042(20)30344-8?_returnURL=https%3A%2F%2Flinkinghub.elsevier.com%2Fretrieve%2Fpii%2FS2589004220303448%3Fshowall%3Dtrue)。社会的重要性と実験構造生物学上の難しさから、AF-"
"MI の [原著](https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.01.19.524720v1.full) "
"では TDP-43 WtoA を選び、Structural Ensemble を AF-MI で生成して実験データと比較しました。"

#: case_study.md:14
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we start with the AF predicted structure of TDP-43 WtoA, "
"employ CALVADOS-2 coarse grained forcefield while adding RMSD restraints to "
"maintain the folded domains and use AF inter-residue distances as restraints"
" within the Metainference framework. We then generate the unbiased "
"structural ensemble, by properly accounting the MetaD bias, followed by "
"ploting free energy surface along different collective variables, and "
"calculation of the secondary structure elements and RMSF."
msgstr ""
"この Tutorial では AF が予測した TDP-43 WtoA 構造から開始し、CALVADOS-2 Coarse-grained Force "
"Field を用います。Folded Domain を維持する RMSD Restraint を加え、AF の残基間距離を Metainference "
"の Restraint として使います。その後 MetaD Bias を適切に考慮して Unbiased Structural Ensemble "
"を生成し、各 CV に沿う自由エネルギー表面、Secondary Structure、RMSF を計算します。"

